      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Cursed be Hidell and cursed be Tel!\r\nI will not forgive those who \r\ncondemned my wife, Angela, as a witch \r\nand drove her to take her own life.",
        "Jp" : "ハイデルに、テルに呪いあれ――！\r\n妻アンヘラを魔女と糾弾し、自死に追い込んだ\r\n者たちをわたしは許さない"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 215127,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 1,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "And I will not forgive those \r\nwho continued to gaze with hollow eyes \r\nof indifference and neglect. \r\nWhether it be 10, 50, \r\nor even 100 years—",
        "Jp" : "そして、無視と無関心でうつろな目を\r\nむけ続けた者たちを許さない\r\n10年、50年、100年経とうと――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 215130,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 1,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "My life, take the form of a curse \r\nand corrupt this land. \r\nBecome a sickness \r\nand infest these souls—",
        "Jp" : "我が命よ、呪いとなりてこの地を冒したまえ\r\n病となりて者どもを蝕みたまえ――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 215133,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 1,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
